Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.06,0:00:24.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记得在肯尼迪文化中心过的八岁生日\N{\rEng}I remember my 8th birthday at the KCC
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.58,0:00:26.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有个超大的蛋糕\N{\rEng}with that giant cake
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.33,0:00:29.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊维姑妈休假过来了  给了大家一个惊喜\N{\rEng}and Aunt Evie showing up on leave, surprising all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.55,0:00:31.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记得妈妈\N{\rEng}I remember Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.00,0:00:34.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记得科奇\N{\rEng}I remember Codger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.27,0:00:39.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记得上学  去看电影\N{\rEng}I remember school and going to the movies
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.43,0:00:43.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,周五晚上吃披萨  动画片\N{\rEng}and Friday-night pizza and cartoons
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.78,0:00:45.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祖父母  教堂\N{\rEng}and Grandma and Grandpa and church,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.53,0:00:49.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏季烧烤  还有你给我买的儿童泳池\N{\rEng}those summer barbecues, and the kiddie pool you got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.04,0:00:51.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是监狱有就好了 \N{\rEng}Could've used that at the prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.24,0:00:55.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说过我三岁时我们去散步\N{\rEng}You told me about the walks we'd take when I was 3,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.27,0:00:58.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你拉着我的手  在街区漫步\N{\rEng}you holding my hand, around the neighborhood,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.60,0:01:00.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去了罗斯的农场\N{\rEng}all the way to Ross' farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.67,0:01:02.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道我还记得那一切  但我真记得\N{\rEng}I didn't know that I remembered them, but I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.45,0:01:06.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我能看见阳光  玉米\N{\rEng}'Cause I see the sun and the corn
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.14,0:01:09.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走到篱笆边上看着我眼睛的奶牛\N{\rEng}and that cow that walked up to the fence and looked me in the eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.29,0:01:10.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跟我说过这一切\N{\rEng}And you told me about all that stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.79,0:01:13.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但重点不是那些事\N{\rEng}but it isn't just that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.13,0:01:15.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是我的感受\N{\rEng}It's how I felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.78,0:01:19.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,牵着你的手  我觉得幸福  特别\N{\rEng}Holding your hand, I felt happy and special.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.61,0:01:20.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得安全\N{\rEng}I felt safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.06,0:01:26.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为成长就是找份工作\N{\rEng}I thought growing up was about getting a job
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.24,0:01:28.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,组建家庭  做个成年人\N{\rEng}and maybe a family, being an adult,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.92,0:01:31.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但成长其实是保证你自己\N{\rEng}but growing up is making yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.95,0:01:33.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和你爱的人的安全\N{\rEng}and the people you love safe --
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.14,0:01:37.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽可能地安全  因为会有意外发生\N{\rEng}as safe as you can, because things happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.85,0:01:38.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之前就发生过\N{\rEng}They happened before.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.73,0:01:40.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切变糟之前你中枪了\N{\rEng}You were shot before things went bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.71,0:01:44.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉好像一切变糟就是因为你中枪了\N{\rEng}Kind of felt like things went bad because you were shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.86,0:01:47.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望让你觉得安全  爸爸\N{\rEng}I want to make you feel safe, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.69,0:01:51.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望让你感受到你牵着我时我的感受\N{\rEng}I want you to feel just like I felt when you held my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.08,0:01:54.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就那样感受五分钟\N{\rEng}Just to feel that way for five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.95,0:01:57.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我宁愿付出一切  让你现在也有那种感受\N{\rEng}I'd give anything to make you feel that way now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.64,0:02:01.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我曾想杀了尼根\N{\rEng}I wanted to kill Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.71,0:02:05.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真希望我做到了  也许就结束了\N{\rEng}I wish I did. Maybe it would've been done.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.24,0:02:08.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得现在还没结束  你又出去了\N{\rEng}I don't think it's done now. You went out there again,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.95,0:02:10.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我觉得他们没投降\N{\rEng}but I don't think they surrendered.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.15,0:02:11.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得他们不会投降\N{\rEng}I don't think they will surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.09,0:02:18.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救世堂里面有工人  爸爸\N{\rEng}There are workers in there, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.56,0:02:20.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们只是普通人\N{\rEng}They're just regular people --
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.08,0:02:22.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老人  年轻人  家人\N{\rEng}old people, young people, families.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.11,0:02:24.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不希望他们死掉  爸爸\N{\rEng}You don't want them to die, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.91,0:02:27.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们差一点就可以重新开始了\N{\rEng}We're so close to starting everything over,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.82,0:02:29.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们现在有朋友了\N{\rEng}and we have friends now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.65,0:02:31.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是耶稣说过的更广阔的世界\N{\rEng}It's that bigger world Jesus talked about --
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.09,0:02:33.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神之国  山顶寨\N{\rEng}the Kingdom, the Hilltop --
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.38,0:02:36.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定还有更多地方\N{\rEng}there's -- there's got to be more places,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.83,0:02:37.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,更多人\N{\rEng}more people out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.80,0:02:40.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让一切改变  继续改变的机会\N{\rEng}a chance for everything to change and keep changing,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.29,0:02:51.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家给彼此生活的机会\N{\rEng}everyone giving everyone the opportunity to have a life --
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.95,0:02:53.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真正的生活\N{\rEng}a real life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.99,0:02:56.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以如果他们不终结这一切  那你就必须这样做\N{\rEng}So if they won't end it, you have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.12,0:02:58.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你必须给他们一条出路\N{\rEng}You have to give them a way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.30,0:03:01.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得跟尼根和平共处\N{\rEng}You have to find peace with Negan,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.33,0:03:03.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想办法找到前进的道路\N{\rEng}find a way forward somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.22,0:03:05.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们没必要忘掉发生的事\N{\rEng}We don't have to forget what happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.25,0:03:08.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你可以确保那些事不再发生\N{\rEng}but you can make it so that it won't happen again,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.76,0:03:10.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人必须那样生活\N{\rEng}that nobody has to live this way,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.26,0:03:12.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个生命都是有价值的\N{\rEng}that every life is worth something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.55,0:03:14.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重新开始吧\N{\rEng}Start everything over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.89,0:03:17.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向大家展示无需杀戮也能重获安全\N{\rEng}Show everyone that they can be safe again without killing,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.95,0:03:19.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能重新有安全感\N{\rEng}that it can feel safe again,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.42,0:03:22.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切能回到过去的样子\N{\rEng}that it could go back to being birthdays
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.19,0:03:24.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生日  上学  上班  \N{\rEng}and school and jobs and
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.30,0:03:26.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至是周五晚上吃披萨\N{\rEng}even Friday-night pizza somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.41,0:03:29.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸和三岁小孩手拉手散步\N{\rEng}And walks with a dad and a 3-year-old holding hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.54,0:03:31.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让那一切回来吧  爸爸\N{\rEng}Make that come back, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.72,0:03:33.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续跟朱迪思散步吧\N{\rEng}And go on those walks with Judith.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.27,0:03:35.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她会记得的\N{\rEng}She'll remember them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.66,0:03:37.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\rEng}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.54,0:03:39.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡尔\N{\rEng}Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.03,0:04:26.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fs18\b1\bord1\shad1\3c&H2F2F2F&}尼根
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.47,0:05:04.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.74,0:05:25.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回来是为了弥补过错\N{\rEng}I came back here to make amends.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.73,0:06:04.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你让我看起来像个混蛋\N{\rEng}You made me look like an ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.07,0:06:06.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的情报不够新\N{\rEng}My intel wasn't current.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.66,0:06:09.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚历山大的情况变了\N{\rEng}You know, things changed at Alexandria.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.91,0:06:13.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魅力\N{\rEng}Juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.38,0:06:18.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魅力和势头能改变局势\N{\rEng}Juice and momentum can change the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.92,0:06:21.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们有  也改变了\N{\rEng}They had it, and they did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.03,0:06:25.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛格丽特掌控了山顶寨\N{\rEng}Margaret had the Hilltop by the nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.18,0:06:26.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当时不知道\N{\rEng}I didn't know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.31,0:06:28.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是  我们付出了代价\N{\rEng}And, yes, we paid a price.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.72,0:06:32.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但让我向尼根赎罪吧\N{\rEng}But let me make it right with Negan, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.74,0:06:35.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是尼根\N{\rEng}I'm Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.98,0:06:41.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说的不是集体的"我们都是尼根"那一套\N{\rEng}And not in a collective, "We're all Negan" sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.38,0:06:43.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是救世军的现任掌权者\N{\rEng}I have assumed control of the Saviors.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.98,0:06:46.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼根已经下线了\N{\rEng}Negan is no longer on the field of play.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.74,0:06:50.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在你是老大吗\N{\rEng}You're the man now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.99,0:06:52.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\rEng}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.78,0:06:54.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就知道\N{\rEng}I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.15,0:06:59.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就知道你能行\N{\rEng}I knew you could do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.72,0:07:03.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼根很有个性  我知道\N{\rEng}Negan was a big personality, I get it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.67,0:07:04.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他...\N{\rEng}but, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.78,0:07:07.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太标新立异了\N{\rEng}too unconventional.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.29,0:07:09.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心慈手软\N{\rEng}Pulled his punches.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.52,0:07:10.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错\N{\rEng}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.59,0:07:13.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你恰恰是那种大家可以依赖的\N{\rEng}Whereas you are the kind of man people can look at
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.37,0:07:16.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并赞美"这才像是个领袖"的人\N{\rEng}and say, "Now there is a leader."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.32,0:07:18.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正因如此\N{\rEng}Which is why
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.74,0:07:22.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不能让大家看到我对你留情\N{\rEng}I can't be seen going easy on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.46,0:07:24.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做做场面\N{\rEng}Optics.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.27,0:08:04.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在不用担心场面的问题\N{\rEng}You don't have to worry about optics now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.02,0:08:06.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-因为你...  -我知道\N{\rEng}- 'Cause you -- - ‭Oh, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.90,0:08:08.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有那种魅力\N{\rEng}I have that juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.10,0:08:11.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有那种势头\N{\rEng}I have that momentum.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.17,0:08:14.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想保持下去\N{\rEng}I want to keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.74,0:08:16.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因此  你得上路\N{\rEng}Ergo, you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.68,0:08:21.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那真是惊人的愚蠢\N{\rEng}Well, that is just breathlessly stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.46,0:08:21.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错\N{\rEng}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.92,0:08:23.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得这里这群原始人\N{\rEng}You think these Troglodytes here
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.07,0:08:26.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会在管理社区上\N{\rEng}are gonna advise you in managing communities,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.69,0:08:28.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以及整合资源上给你建议吗\N{\rEng}in resource reallocations?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.20,0:08:30.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有政治上\N{\rEng}In politics?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.74,0:08:31.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错\N{\rEng}That's right, yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.89,0:08:35.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,残酷无情的政治\N{\rEng}the bare-knuckle gnad mash of politics?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.49,0:08:38.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经  结束了  格雷戈里\N{\rEng}It is ended, Gregory.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.92,0:08:41.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我已经取得了这么多成就\N{\rEng}No! I've achieved too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.80,0:08:43.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我受了这么多苦\N{\rEng}I-I-I've suffered too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.49,0:08:46.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我生存了这么久  不是为了这种结局\N{\rEng}I've survived too much for it to end like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.75,0:08:48.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我走在风口浪尖\N{\rEng}I've lashed myself to the bow,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.92,0:08:49.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,经历了大风大浪\N{\rEng}seen through the storm,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.85,0:08:54.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重生成了一名合格的问题解决者\N{\rEng}and I have been reborn as a-a certified shit kicker!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.74,0:08:56.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能做成事\N{\rEng}I make things happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.60,0:08:58.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我总是能做成事\N{\rEng}I've always made things happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.62,0:09:03.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一切不能以我走进荒野\N{\rEng}And it's not gonna end with me wandering off into the wilderness
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.36,0:09:05.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手里抓着自己的鸟为结局\N{\rEng}with my dick in my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.44,0:09:08.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在一切分崩离析时我力挽狂澜\N{\rEng}I put things together when everything fell apart,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.80,0:09:10.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以再次做到这点\N{\rEng}and I can do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.08,0:09:11.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会再次做到这点的\N{\rEng}I will do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.29,0:09:15.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你他妈算哪根葱来说我完了\N{\rEng}You know, who the hell are you to tell me I'm done?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.99,0:09:18.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为自己有魅力是吧\N{\rEng}Yeah, you think you have the juice?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.02,0:09:20.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老子就是魅力化身\N{\rEng}Well, I am the juice!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.27,0:09:22.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\rEng}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.68,0:09:32.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先...\N{\rEng}First...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.44,0:09:35.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是要赶走你\N{\rEng}I wasn't gonna send you away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.49,0:09:37.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是要杀了你\N{\rEng}I was gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.61,0:09:42.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其次...\N{\rEng}Second...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.69,0:09:45.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会煮咖啡吗\N{\rEng}do you make coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.84,0:09:51.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地表最香\N{\rEng}Best in the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.65,0:09:57.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就先从煮咖啡开始  然后再说\N{\rEng}We'll start with coffee and see where it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.43,0:10:00.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还在外面\N{\rEng}He's still out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.19,0:10:02.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走的时候没看见他\N{\rEng}Didn't see him when we left.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.03,0:10:04.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许他终于放弃了\N{\rEng}Maybe he finally gave up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.63,0:10:06.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  他不会的\N{\rEng}Nope. He won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.09,0:10:08.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非是在我们的逼迫之下\N{\rEng}Not unless we make him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.12,0:10:11.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们应该直接杀了他\N{\rEng}We should just kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.07,0:10:16.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来\N{\rEng}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.71,0:10:26.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早告诉你了\N{\rEng}Told ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.68,0:10:33.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他有吃过东西吗\N{\rEng}Has he eaten?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.48,0:10:39.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们做出了选择\N{\rEng}We made our choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.91,0:10:42.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想死在树林里\N{\rEng}He wants to die in the woods,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.34,0:10:43.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,指望着我们改变想法\N{\rEng}hoping we change our minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.24,0:10:45.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是他自己的选择\N{\rEng}That's his choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.53,0:10:49.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去找点水喝吧\N{\rEng}Find yourself some water.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.33,0:10:59.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我看来这是浪费大蒜\N{\rEng}Seems like a waste of good garlic to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.74,0:11:01.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是浪费其他食材\N{\rEng}And everything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.45,0:11:04.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给你们的沙丁鱼芝士通心粉配方\N{\rEng}That sardine mac-and-cheese recipe I gave you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.43,0:11:06.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我大学时期的主食\N{\rEng}was a staple from my college days
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.31,0:11:08.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作为一个囊中羞涩的学生\N{\rEng}when, ‭as a cash-strapped student,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.22,0:11:11.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得尽可能搭配好经济实惠的\N{\rEng}I had to pad out ‭the budget-minded goodness
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.80,0:11:13.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芝士末和通心粉\N{\rEng}of M-and-powdered-C
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.80,0:11:16.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以及沙丁鱼罐头所含的蛋白质...\N{\rEng}with the protein power of canned sardines...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.80,0:11:20.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这能比碳水化合物更加长久地\N{\rEng}which provided ‭a longer-lasting energy source
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.26,0:11:21.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为人体提供能量\N{\rEng}than pure carbohydrates.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.33,0:11:25.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而煎大蒜纯粹是一次巧合的发现\N{\rEng}The garlic sauté alleys what originated as a purely "Oops" dish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.65,0:11:32.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唤起了我的回忆\N{\rEng}Takes me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.79,0:11:37.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始装盘吧  今后只吃这道菜\N{\rEng}Start plating it up. This is all that's on the menu
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.94,0:11:39.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直到订单完成\N{\rEng}for the rest of the time till this order's complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.02,0:11:51.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想提醒大家  我们的性命没有保障\N{\rEng}I'd like to remind everyone that our lives are not on lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.63,0:11:57.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出于与尼根的互相尊重\N{\rEng}Out of personal respect to the mutual nature with Negan,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.47,0:12:00.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但尼根现在失踪了\N{\rEng}but Negan is M.I.A..
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.55,0:12:05.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西蒙接管了  他已经要求产量指数级增加\N{\rEng}Simon has taken over, and he has requested an exponential acceleration of production.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.31,0:12:11.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快速造更多子弹\N{\rEng}More shots on the lickety-quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.54,0:12:16.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使我们不顾生产安全\N{\rEng}Even if we're double-timing it around the clock
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.17,0:12:18.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日以继夜赶工\N{\rEng}with nary a carey for workplace safety,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.70,0:12:25.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也会与不切实际的订单存在巨大差距\N{\rEng}it isn't gonna prevent us from meeting our quixotic quota by the proverbial crap-ton.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.40,0:12:27.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们唯可指望的是\N{\rEng}The best that we can hope for
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.25,0:12:33.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想办法先造出所需的最低数量\N{\rEng}is that we somehow manage to squeeze out the bare minimum number of rounds necessary
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.39,0:12:37.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,免得西蒙发现产量不足而惩罚我们\N{\rEng}to avoid the consequences of Simon finding out how short we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.41,0:12:52.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\rEng}No. ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.09,0:12:54.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上把口罩戴好\N{\rEng}Put that mask back on now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.89,0:13:00.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们最不能承担的事就是\N{\rEng}The last thing we can afford is for yours truly
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.65,0:13:03.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让本人染上你因不当处理内脏\N{\rEng}to contract whatever kind of nasty infected you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.30,0:13:05.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而染上的恶心病毒\N{\rEng}with your improper gut handling.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.61,0:13:08.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我目前认为  要么是流感\N{\rEng}My current theory is that it's either influenza
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.44,0:13:10.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要么是空气传播的隐球菌\N{\rEng}or cryptococcosis and therefore airborne.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.20,0:13:13.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果是血液病  你早就死了\N{\rEng}If it was of the blood variety, you would've already been dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.69,0:13:16.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但现实是你体内依然有可通过打喷嚏\N{\rEng}But the fact remains you're packing pathogens
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.46,0:13:17.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,传染的病原体\N{\rEng}that can sting with a sneeze,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.76,0:13:20.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你在进行药物治疗的同时\N{\rEng}making it imperative that you maintain your P.P.E.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.02,0:13:22.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必须佩戴个人防护装备\N{\rEng}at all times while your meds run their course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.20,0:13:23.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在张开手\N{\rEng}Now hold out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.83,0:13:32.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感受一下\N{\rEng}Feel that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.24,0:13:38.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,底火不平\N{\rEng}Primers aren't flush.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.40,0:13:41.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种成品子弹存在致命风险\N{\rEng}The finished rounds pose the deadly risk
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.07,0:13:43.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,装入枪膛就可能走火\N{\rEng}of slam-firing as soon as they're loaded into the chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.67,0:13:46.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鉴于这种缺陷触手可知\N{\rEng}Given that this imperfection is readily evident to the touch,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.14,0:13:49.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只能猜测你是故意疏忽的\N{\rEng}I can only assume that this oversight was purely intentional.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.42,0:13:50.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.41,0:13:52.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\rEng}I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.73,0:13:57.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只想要一个打不响的哑弹\N{\rEng}I just wanted to make it so that the bullets didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.14,0:13:59.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并不想伤害任何人\N{\rEng}I wasn't trying to hurt anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.50,0:14:03.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不希望自己人有任何牺牲\N{\rEng}I don't want any of my people to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.80,0:14:05.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你不能接受我们现在才是你的自己人\N{\rEng}If you cannot accept that we're your people now,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.54,0:14:06.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你完全可以省去麻烦\N{\rEng}you may as well cut to the chase
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.84,0:14:08.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲自品尝生产线上的下颗子弹\N{\rEng}and chew the next bullet coming off that line.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.76,0:14:10.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你希望这样吗\N{\rEng}Is that what you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.42,0:14:12.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.02,0:14:16.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不希望这样\N{\rEng}That's not what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.59,0:14:17.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不希望\N{\rEng}I don't want that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.94,0:14:22.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想帮你\N{\rEng}I don't want to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.98,0:14:23.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是\N{\rEng}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.97,0:14:28.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也怕死\N{\rEng}I do fear death.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.68,0:14:35.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许这一切  是上帝用祂的方法\N{\rEng}Maybe all this...maybe this is just his way
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.26,0:14:37.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我  我并没有改变\N{\rEng}of showing me ‭that I haven't changed...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.14,0:14:40.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我  我还是从前那个\N{\rEng}a way of showing me that I'm still
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.32,0:14:46.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把教民锁在外面的恶人\N{\rEng}the same person who locked my parishioners out so long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.78,0:14:49.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还是那个吓破胆的禽兽\N{\rEng}I'm still the same scared animal,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.77,0:14:52.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和你一样  做着能让自己苟且偷生的事\N{\rEng}doing what I must to survive just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.69,0:14:53.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许不久之后\N{\rEng}Being alive may be something
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.74,0:14:55.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,活着就不是我们的共同点了\N{\rEng}we don't have in common for much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.00,0:15:00.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在被停职了\N{\rEng}You are hereby suspended from the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.80,0:15:03.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去找个不显眼的角落\N{\rEng}Go find an unobtrusive corner
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.35,0:15:05.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自己难受去  手套别摘了\N{\rEng}and stow your load ‭and keep your mitts to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.77,0:15:12.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哭声别太大\N{\rEng}And try not to cry too loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.10,0:15:18.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想去外面测试一下\N{\rEng}I want to go outside and test-fire some of these rounds
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.86,0:15:21.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还没有破坏的子弹\N{\rEng}that you didn't compromise with your chicanery.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.52,0:16:00.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到我很吃惊吗\N{\rEng}Surprised to see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.31,0:16:02.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不应该的\N{\rEng}Shouldn't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.36,0:16:09.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当然吃惊了\N{\rEng}Hell yeah, I'm surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.28,0:16:12.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们找到了你的车  西蒙以为...\N{\rEng}We found your car, ‭and Simon thought that...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.06,0:16:13.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮把手好吗\N{\rEng}Give me a hand with this, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.93,0:16:26.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说实话  当瑞克把我逼到\N{\rEng}Not gonna lie...a real punch in the dick
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.57,0:16:28.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,满是腐尸的地下室\N{\rEng}when Rick cornered me in the basement
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.21,0:16:30.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你们却没来的时候\N{\rEng}with those decomposing assholes
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.48,0:16:32.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是令我难过\N{\rEng}and you fellas never showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.78,0:16:39.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西蒙想着...\N{\rEng}Simon thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.33,0:16:42.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想知道你的想法\N{\rEng}I want to know what you were thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.41,0:16:49.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想知道你还记不记得自己是谁\N{\rEng}See, I want to know if you remember who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.09,0:16:54.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次谈话不外传\N{\rEng}This little talk ‭is just between me and you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.04,0:16:59.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西蒙是你的二把手\N{\rEng}Simon's your number two.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.59,0:17:02.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为你想让他做决定\N{\rEng}I thought you wanted him calling it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.30,0:17:04.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记得我是谁\N{\rEng}I remember who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.06,0:17:07.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是尼根\N{\rEng}I'm Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.78,0:17:12.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好\N{\rEng}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.67,0:17:15.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就想听到这个\N{\rEng}That's what I like to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.93,0:17:18.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮我个忙\N{\rEng}Now do me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.92,0:17:22.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把烟在这灭了\N{\rEng}Put that smoke out right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.29,0:17:30.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等时机成熟\N{\rEng}See, when the time comes --
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.54,0:17:32.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会知道何时成熟的\N{\rEng}and you will know when it comes --
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.41,0:17:34.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望你记住我们的谈话\N{\rEng}I want you to remember this little talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.53,0:17:39.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望你记住我们以前的成就\N{\rEng}I want you to remember what we've done
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.70,0:17:43.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以及我们以后能取得的成就\N{\rEng}and what we can still do together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.53,0:18:08.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为他们杀了你  你死了  就像...\N{\rEng}I thought they killed you and that you were gone, like --
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.03,0:18:11.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像那样\N{\rEng}-- like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.14,0:18:30.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我缺乏纪律\N{\rEng}I lacked discipline.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.99,0:18:33.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我带入了私人情绪\N{\rEng}And I made it personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.98,0:18:41.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我才把对山顶寨的命令从感染\N{\rEng}And that's why I moved things from infection to extermination
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.31,0:18:42.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,改成了消灭\N{\rEng}at the Hilltop.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.78,0:18:44.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错\N{\rEng}Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.22,0:18:48.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出了岔子\N{\rEng}things went bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.81,0:18:53.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽管我觉得不管用何种方法\N{\rEng}Though I think it's possible we may have found ourselves
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.16,0:18:56.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都可能陷入同样危险的境地\N{\rEng}in a similar tactical situation, regardless of approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.49,0:18:57.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这很难说\N{\rEng}We don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.27,0:19:01.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认了\N{\rEng}So I'll own it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.80,0:19:07.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只求你原谅我这一次\N{\rEng}I just ask that you give me a pass on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.93,0:19:10.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会补偿你的\N{\rEng}I'll make it up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.27,0:19:12.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我保证\N{\rEng}I promise you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.54,0:19:20.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还记得当我占领这里的时候\N{\rEng}You know, I remember when I took this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.39,0:19:31.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当你帮我占领这里的时候\N{\rEng}When you helped me take this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.65,0:19:35.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当时也不确定想不想带着你\N{\rEng}Wasn't sure I wanted to keep you on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.60,0:19:37.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我之前\N{\rEng}I mean, before me,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.59,0:19:40.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在一切有秩序之前\N{\rEng}before there was a system in place,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.41,0:19:45.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很久以前做的那些事\N{\rEng}what you did, killing all those men,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.31,0:19:48.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀的那些成人和孩子\N{\rEng}those boys in that settlement so long ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.83,0:19:53.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很多人会觉得你是失心疯\N{\rEng}a lot of people would think that is some psychotic shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.23,0:19:58.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像是一个精神错乱  失控  崩溃的恶鬼\N{\rEng}Like that is the work of a demented,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.62,0:20:01.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才能做出那种事\N{\rEng}broken, goddamn ghoul.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.65,0:20:04.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你根本不想和这种人合作\N{\rEng}Like that's not someone that you want to work with,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.13,0:20:06.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,更别提在一起了\N{\rEng}let alone stand next to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.34,0:20:10.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我想着我得盯好你\N{\rEng}So I figured I'd keep my eye on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.55,0:20:12.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的确是这么做的\N{\rEng}And I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.17,0:20:19.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直到此刻前  一切都好像没有问题\N{\rEng}And everything seemed to work out right up until this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.54,0:20:27.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要你给我跪下\N{\rEng}I'm gonna need you on your knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.65,0:20:55.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不打算做点什么吗  还是说你认命了\N{\rEng}You gonna make a move, or is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.12,0:21:01.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么好做的\N{\rEng}No move to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.75,0:21:04.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.52,0:21:07.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,的确没有\N{\rEng}There isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.32,0:21:16.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我原谅你了\N{\rEng}All is forgiven.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.99,0:21:20.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起来吧\N{\rEng}Get your ass up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.97,0:21:21.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们没事了\N{\rEng}We're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.10,0:21:36.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会让你失望的\N{\rEng}I won't let you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.56,0:21:39.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会的\N{\rEng}Not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.18,0:21:42.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我非常感谢\N{\rEng}I appreciate the hell out of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.64,0:21:56.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就从这里开始\N{\rEng}This is where we start --
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.18,0:21:58.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的第一个新补给站\N{\rEng}the first of our new staging posts.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.74,0:22:01.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不用占领山顶寨\N{\rEng}See, we do not have to take the Hilltop.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.65,0:22:04.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们只需要确保那些农民跑不出来\N{\rEng}We just have to make sure that the farmers can't leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.00,0:22:07.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们保持机动  轻装上路\N{\rEng}We stay nimble. We stay light.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.31,0:22:11.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要有人敢探头  我们就打他们\N{\rEng}We plink their asses every time one of them tries to poke their head out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.89,0:22:15.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时候从正前面  有时候从一英里之外\N{\rEng}Sometimes right in front, sometimes from a mile away,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.52,0:22:19.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但每次都会打\N{\rEng}but every goddamn time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.35,0:22:39.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天下午\N{\rEng}Tomorrow afternoon,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.53,0:22:43.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要率领一支十人小队去这里\N{\rEng}I am going to take a 10-head team to this spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.88,0:22:48.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,存下补给和机灵鬼博士做的弹药\N{\rEng}I am stocking it with supplies and ammo that Dr. Smartypants are making.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.37,0:22:53.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里的其他人要在不同的地点\N{\rEng}Everyone else here is gonna do the same thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.56,0:22:56.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同时做同样的事\N{\rEng}same time, different spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.19,0:22:58.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到明天晚上  我们就在山顶寨边\N{\rEng}End of day tomorrow, we will have cache after cache
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.95,0:23:00.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了一圈据点\N{\rEng}around that Hilltop
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.33,0:23:03.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,距离足够我们随时补给\N{\rEng}and always be spitting distance from a reload.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.25,0:23:08.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安排小队全天候把守山顶寨\N{\rEng}There will be teams 24/7 around that place...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.38,0:23:13.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狙杀他们  一个接一个  一天接一天\N{\rEng}snipin' them, one by one, day after day,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.14,0:23:15.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直到我们\N{\rEng}until we have full...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.72,0:23:17.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀光他们\N{\rEng}attrition.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.02,0:23:30.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只能说  这是一项非常有雄心的计划\N{\rEng}It's an ambitious plan with testicular heft, I'll give you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.20,0:23:34.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很高兴你回来了  老大\N{\rEng}Very happy to have you back, boss man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.80,0:23:37.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回来可真好\N{\rEng}Damn good to be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.60,0:23:39.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  大家散会吧\N{\rEng}All right, everybody, clear out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.01,0:23:41.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了你  德怀特\N{\rEng}Except for you, Dwight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.90,0:23:46.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还有些事要谈\N{\rEng}Got a few things we need to kick around.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.80,0:24:30.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很聪明\N{\rEng}You are smart as hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.20,0:24:31.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道吗\N{\rEng}You know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.55,0:24:33.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使发生了这么多事\N{\rEng}I mean, after everything --
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.51,0:24:37.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪莉  烫伤\N{\rEng}Sherry, the sizzle...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.36,0:24:40.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没有焦躁  你没做蠢事\N{\rEng}you didn't stew, ‭you didn't do anything stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.96,0:24:44.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只是朝自己想要的迈进\N{\rEng}You just went about the business of getting yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.07,0:24:50.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么能撼动你\N{\rEng}Nothing shook you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.18,0:24:53.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一直紧盯着\N{\rEng}You kept your eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.14,0:24:56.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能让你好好活下去的事物\N{\rEng}on what could keep you alive and well.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.86,0:25:04.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你保持着头脑清醒\N{\rEng}You keep on ‭keeping that shit clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.73,0:27:34.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不禁怀疑\N{\rEng}I can't help but suspect
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.80,0:27:38.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我被活捉是因为\N{\rEng}that the reason I'm being taken alive is, despite...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.21,0:27:42.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然我们之间有不容置疑的过节\N{\rEng}what completely warranted bad blood exists between us,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.61,0:27:46.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你们仍念及我们昔日的情分\N{\rEng}you still harbor a vestigial nostalgia for our erstwhile camaraderie.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.76,0:27:49.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鉴于此  我愿意闭上本人的嘴\N{\rEng}And in light of that, i'm willing to just shut my grub flap
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.53,0:27:51.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给你们空间\N{\rEng}and give you your space
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.46,0:27:54.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直到你们准备好打破沉默\N{\rEng}until you see such a time as you're ready to break the ice,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.79,0:27:55.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个旅伴...\N{\rEng}one traveling companion --
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.68,0:27:58.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭上狗嘴  否则我把你舌头割下来\N{\rEng}Shut your mouth ‭before I cut your tongue out!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.17,0:27:59.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\rEng}All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.30,0:28:02.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得继续前进\N{\rEng}We got to keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.23,0:28:04.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们肯定已经出来找他了\N{\rEng}They have to be out looking for him by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.40,0:28:15.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-谢谢你  我...  -闭嘴\N{\rEng}- Thank you. I -- - ‭Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.50,0:28:19.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走\N{\rEng}Let's go. ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.27,0:28:53.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我告诉尼根我造了子弹\N{\rEng}When I told Negan I made the bullet,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.72,0:28:55.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是为了救你\N{\rEng}it was to save your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.38,0:28:59.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当时没多想  就是帮你说话\N{\rEng}I didn't think. ‭I just acted on your behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.59,0:29:02.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为棍棒击下来的声音\N{\rEng}And I fully expected the crack of the bat
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.62,0:29:03.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会是我最后听到的声音\N{\rEng}to be the last thing I heard,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.78,0:29:05.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但那并没发生\N{\rEng}but that didn't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.50,0:29:08.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后我想着他们会折磨我\N{\rEng}And then I thought they would torture me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.26,0:29:10.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他们没有\N{\rEng}But they didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.53,0:29:14.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们给了我一个活下去的机会\N{\rEng}They gave me a chance to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.92,0:29:16.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我试过抗拒\N{\rEng}And I tried to resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.91,0:29:19.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我试着战胜自己的本性\N{\rEng}I tried to rise above my biological imperative,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.52,0:29:20.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我不是那样的人\N{\rEng}but that is not who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.78,0:29:21.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你是什么样的人\N{\rEng}I know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.44,0:29:24.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们能逃离救世堂都是因为你\N{\rEng}You're the reason they were able to escape the Sanctuary.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.02,0:29:26.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之后发生的所有事\N{\rEng}Everything that's happened since then,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.24,0:29:28.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死的每个人  都怪你\N{\rEng}everyone who's died, that's on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.99,0:29:38.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是瑞克迫使我们挑战救世军\N{\rEng}Rick's the one who pushed us all to take the Saviors on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.11,0:29:42.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是他不做好准备就一头扎进这趟浑水\N{\rEng}He's the one who jumped headlong into this shit-storm with no waders.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.51,0:29:46.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你自私无比\N{\rEng}You're selfish,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.86,0:29:49.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还是个懦夫  叛徒\N{\rEng}and you're a coward, and you're a traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.08,0:29:52.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你背叛了你此生仅有的朋友们\N{\rEng}You turned you back on the only friends you ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.46,0:29:53.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这里一枪打爆你的脑袋\N{\rEng}Shooting you in the head right here
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.50,0:29:55.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会让世界更美好\N{\rEng}would actually make the world a better place.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.04,0:30:01.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们不打算杀你\N{\rEng}But we're not gonna kill you,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.88,0:30:03.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是因为我们在乎你\N{\rEng}not because ‭we give a rat's ass about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.94,0:30:05.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们只是需要你脑子里的知识\N{\rEng}We just need what's in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.69,0:30:09.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会把你关进最阴暗的黑洞里\N{\rEng}We're gonna stick you in the darkest hole we can find,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.87,0:30:11.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你唯一能看到阳光的机会\N{\rEng}and the only time ‭you'll see the light of day
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.51,0:30:13.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我们需要你教我们做某事的时候\N{\rEng}is when we need you ‭to teach us how to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.01,0:30:18.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以别担心  你会如愿的\N{\rEng}So don't worry -- you'll get what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.58,0:30:19.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会活下去\N{\rEng}You'll live.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.69,0:30:22.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们会逼你用你可悲的人生\N{\rEng}But we're gonna force you to do something useful
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.72,0:30:24.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做些有用的事\N{\rEng}with your pathetic life.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.42,0:30:48.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fs18\b1\bord1\shad1\3c&H2F2F2F&}明天下午  尼根和十个手下在X处\N圆圈处各有一支十一人小队\N杀死尼根  杀死剩下的人  了结这一切
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.93,0:31:08.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会议进行得很顺利\N{\rEng}Meeting went well.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.91,0:31:11.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经恢复原状\N{\rEng}Status quo has been re-achieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.00,0:31:13.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他为什么留下你\N{\rEng}What'd he hold you back for?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.81,0:31:16.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是给我打打气\N{\rEng}You know, a... pep talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.02,0:31:20.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得谈谈\N{\rEng}Mm. We need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.78,0:31:26.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟其他对现任管理层有意见的人认真谈谈\N{\rEng}A serious talk with the others who are less than thrilled with the current management,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.34,0:31:28.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们像你一样  曾参与过\N{\rEng}who, like you, engaged in activities
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.73,0:31:31.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会令该管理层不满的活动\N{\rEng}said management would frown on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.57,0:31:59.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-真要这么做吗  -做不好就去死\N{\rEng}- So this is it? - ‭You deliver or get shipped.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.67,0:32:06.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他没把事情做好  那让我难过\N{\rEng}He hasn't delivered, and that saddens me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.04,0:32:09.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但时候到了\N{\rEng}But the time has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.13,0:32:13.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们集合志同道合的人\N{\rEng}Let us gather ‭our like-minded individuals,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.54,0:32:16.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,齐心协力\N{\rEng}draw strength from each other...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.59,0:32:19.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做我们需要做的事\N{\rEng}and do what we need to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.47,0:32:23.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\rEng}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.96,0:32:26.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还得说服你吗\N{\rEng}I gotta sell this to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.37,0:32:28.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想想他对你做过的事\N{\rEng}Think about everything he's done to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.45,0:32:32.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他从你身上夺走的每一分尊严  你的一切\N{\rEng}every little indignity, everything he's extracted from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.77,0:32:35.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好想想  德怀特  你知道该怎么做\N{\rEng}Think about it, Dwight! You know what you have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.85,0:32:42.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巡逻完之后  来院子见我们\N{\rEng}You have to meet us in the courtyard after rounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.01,0:32:43.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后我们开始下一步\N{\rEng}and we begin what's next.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.85,0:32:46.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊  好吗\N{\rEng}I mean, Jesus, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.10,0:32:54.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\rEng}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.06,0:33:00.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好  乖孩子\N{\rEng}Yes, my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.48,0:33:02.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好\N{\rEng}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.44,0:33:48.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们一定是听见停车声了\N{\rEng}They must've heard us pull up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.92,0:33:50.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交给我\N{\rEng}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.58,0:33:52.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看好他\N{\rEng}Watch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.07,0:34:34.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\rEng}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.17,0:34:50.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不可能跑远\N{\rEng}He couldn't have got far.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.62,0:34:51.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\rEng}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.88,0:34:54.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不能让他回去\N{\rEng}We can't let him get back to them!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.61,0:34:56.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你看到他  打爆他的猪头\N{\rEng}If you see him, blow that pig's head off!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.12,0:36:30.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\rEng}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.88,0:37:21.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他死了吗\N{\rEng}Is he dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.19,0:37:40.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们\N{\rEng}You...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.69,0:37:43.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把娜塔尼亚的死\N{\rEng}You blamed Enid...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.87,0:37:46.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,归咎在伊妮德头上\N{\rEng}for Natania's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.90,0:37:50.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但其实这都是救世军的错\N{\rEng}But it's really the Saviors.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.62,0:37:55.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们对你们做的事  他们逼你们成为的人...\N{\rEng}What they did to you, what they turned you into...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.03,0:37:57.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是他们的错\N{\rEng}it's their fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.27,0:37:59.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们躲起来\N{\rEng}You hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.88,0:38:01.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不相信别人\N{\rEng}You don't trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.64,0:38:05.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为他们  你们不过自己想过的生活\N{\rEng}You don't live the life the way you want to because of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.94,0:38:09.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们伤害过你们\N{\rEng}They hurt you,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.11,0:38:12.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且他们会继续伤害你们\N{\rEng}and they're gonna keep on hurting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.36,0:38:16.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非你们做一件事\N{\rEng}Unless you do one thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.85,0:38:20.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反抗\N{\rEng}Fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.61,0:38:55.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真扯\N{\rEng}Some shit, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.51,0:38:56.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.46,0:39:00.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想着\N{\rEng}Got to think, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.98,0:39:03.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定比我们更想做这事\N{\rEng}you wanted this before we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.77,0:39:25.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你来了这里  就证明你加入了\N{\rEng}If you're here right now, you're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.07,0:39:32.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以讨论方法和策略  但是你加入了\N{\rEng}We can talk about approaches and finesses, but you are in.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.00,0:39:34.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能反悔\N{\rEng}No takebacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.41,0:39:44.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们动手要快  安静  怀着敬意\N{\rEng}We need to make this quick, quiet, and respectful.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.75,0:39:47.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他为我们做过很多事\N{\rEng}Man's done a lot for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.31,0:39:48.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是他应得的待遇\N{\rEng}He deserves that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.36,0:40:13.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你\N{\rEng}You...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.31,0:40:18.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和他有私怨\N{\rEng}have some legitimate personal issues with the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.56,0:40:21.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你想的话  你可以杀他\N{\rEng}The kill is yours if you want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.96,0:40:23.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用安静的方法\N{\rEng}Something quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.66,0:40:24.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是说用刀\N{\rEng}I mean, not a knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.97,0:40:27.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能那么恩怨用事\N{\rEng}Can't make it that personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.78,0:40:30.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用消音器\N{\rEng}A silencer.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.29,0:40:34.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们召集会议\N{\rEng}We call a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.25,0:40:37.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后动手\N{\rEng}And that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.78,0:40:42.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来的任务是接好断骨\N{\rEng}The next order of business is to set the break,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.13,0:40:43.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始疗伤\N{\rEng}to start the healing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.19,0:40:46.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实现这一点的催化剂\N{\rEng}The catalyzing event to facilitate that
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.05,0:40:50.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是消灭山顶寨和其居民\N{\rEng}is the destruction of the Hilltop and its residents.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.87,0:40:54.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,建成一座服从我们的纪念碑\N{\rEng}We'll make it a monument of compliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.37,0:40:55.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  格雷戈里\N{\rEng}Sorry, Gregory.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.75,0:40:57.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后\N{\rEng}And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.49,0:41:01.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们继续生活\N{\rEng}we get on with our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.64,0:41:03.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对吧  德怀特\N{\rEng}Right, Dwight?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.35,0:41:21.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢了  小德\N{\rEng}Thank you, D.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.65,0:41:24.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来换我\N{\rEng}I'll take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.53,0:41:31.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三\N{\rEng}Three...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.38,0:41:34.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二\N{\rEng}two...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.85,0:41:37.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一\N{\rEng}one.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.13,0:41:57.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,德怀特\N{\rEng}Dwight!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.32,0:42:07.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这才是我认识的西蒙\N{\rEng}Now there is the Simon that I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.20,0:42:12.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他直来直去  而不是背后捅刀\N{\rEng}He comes right at you instead of that backstabby bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.29,0:42:15.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\rEng}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.84,0:42:17.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他对你做了那么多事\N{\rEng}After everything he did to you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.06,0:42:19.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么要这样做\N{\rEng}Why do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.49,0:42:21.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会赢的\N{\rEng}He'd win.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.61,0:42:30.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你杀了垃圾场的人  西蒙\N{\rEng}You killed ‭all the garbage people, Simon.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.21,0:42:40.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我特别下令别那样做之后\N{\rEng}After I specifically told you not to do that shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.71,0:43:10.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是\N{\rEng}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.55,0:43:15.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使发生了这些事  即使我的为人你知道\N{\rEng}after all this, and me being me...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.28,0:43:20.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我依然会给你一个机会\N{\rEng}I'm still gonna give you your shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.34,0:43:32.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想当老大  必须先打败老大\N{\rEng}You want to be the man, you got to beat the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.39,0:43:34.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你能做到\N{\rEng}If you can do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.77,0:43:37.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么  去他的\N{\rEng}then, hell...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.78,0:43:41.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你来当老大\N{\rEng}you should be the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.61,0:44:06.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位\N{\rEng}Everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.77,0:44:11.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完事以后  继续工作\N{\rEng}After this is done, we get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.00,0:44:16.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们要知道我并不想这样\N{\rEng}Just know that I didn't want this.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.66,0:44:20.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但救世堂必须屹立下去\N{\rEng}But the Sanctuary must stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.60,0:44:27.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这男人解决不了冲突\N{\rEng}This is not the man to prosecute this conflict.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.58,0:44:31.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只想说\N{\rEng}Just wanted to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.61,0:44:34.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一小群人...\N{\rEng}a grateful enclave --
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.55,0:44:35.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...感谢你\N{\rEng}unh! -- thanks you!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.76,0:45:41.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得赶紧走\N{\rEng}You need to get out of here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.51,0:45:42.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那还用说\N{\rEng}No shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.43,0:45:44.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把这个给瑞克\N{\rEng}Give this to Rick
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.80,0:45:46.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉他明天的事\N{\rEng}and tell him about tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.98,0:45:48.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只能这样做了\N{\rEng}It's the only move you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.10,0:45:52.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在输煤管后面给你留了一辆车\N{\rEng}I left a car for you behind the coal chutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.23,0:45:54.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\rEng}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.62,0:46:01.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在山顶寨全力出击\N{\rEng}You went for it all at the Hilltop.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.30,0:46:04.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你害死了救世军的人\N{\rEng}You got Saviors killed,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.56,0:46:07.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后你像个懦夫一样逃跑了\N{\rEng}and then you ran away like a coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.54,0:46:11.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你失败太多次了\N{\rEng}You got shown up one too many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.39,0:46:13.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些人总会觉得\N{\rEng}Those people, they are always gonna know
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.05,0:46:16.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有漏洞可钻  有办法逃避\N{\rEng}that there's a loophole, a way to skate.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.53,0:46:20.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会一直找机会反抗\N{\rEng}They are always gonna be looking for that chance to push back,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.47,0:46:23.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我现在必须杀光他们\N{\rEng}so now I gotta kill all of 'em
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.55,0:46:25.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像我要杀掉你一样\N{\rEng}just like I'm gonna kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.90,0:46:57.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是个混蛋\N{\rEng}What an asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.35,0:47:42.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办\N{\rEng}What're we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.94,0:47:52.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真他妈可惜  真浪费\N{\rEng}Such a damn shame -- a waste --
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.64,0:47:56.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像个没鸡巴的虫子一样在我背后偷摸搞事\N{\rEng}slinking behind my back like some kind of dickless worm.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.24,0:47:59.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,计划着杀了我\N{\rEng}Planning on killing me...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.24,0:48:00.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我除了掐断他的脖子\N{\rEng}Like, what else am I gonna do
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.74,0:48:02.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有什么选择呢\N{\rEng}besides crush the guy's throat?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.79,0:48:04.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.07,0:48:07.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道吗\N{\rEng}Eh, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.29,0:48:10.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西蒙的坏事  对你来说是好事\N{\rEng}what's bad for Simon, it's good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.08,0:48:13.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道我们关系时好时坏  小德\N{\rEng}And I know we've had our ups and downs, D,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.36,0:48:16.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我总是能依靠你\N{\rEng}but I've always been able to count on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.72,0:48:17.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以\N{\rEng}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.75,0:48:20.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭喜\N{\rEng}congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.23,0:48:22.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在是我的新得力手下了\N{\rEng}You are my new right-hand man.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.03,0:48:25.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然前提是你接受晋升\N{\rEng}That is, ‭if you accept the promotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.07,0:48:28.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我接受\N{\rEng}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.73,0:48:31.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会帮你解决和瑞克的事\N{\rEng}And I'll help you ‭finish this thing with Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.12,0:48:33.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别小看自己  小德\N{\rEng}Don't sell yourself short, D.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.96,0:48:36.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已经帮我解决了\N{\rEng}You already have.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.60,0:48:58.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看起来很惊讶  德怀特\N{\rEng}Well, you look surprised, Dwight.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.62,0:49:01.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在路边找到了她\N{\rEng}Yeah, see, I found her on the side of the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.59,0:49:05.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,劳拉  告诉小德你对我说了什么\N{\rEng}Laura, why don't you tell D what you told me?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.00,0:49:08.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在亚历山大的那一夜  他背叛了我们\N{\rEng}That night in Alexandria, he turned on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.82,0:49:11.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他害死了我们小队\N{\rEng}He killed our team.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.00,0:49:15.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跑掉了  我一直在跑\N{\rEng}I ran, and I kept on running.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.61,0:49:16.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我受伤了\N{\rEng}I was hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.37,0:49:19.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但支撑我活下来的动力是回到这里\N{\rEng}But what kept me alive was the thought of getting back here
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.85,0:49:22.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,揭露你这个叛徒人渣\N{\rEng}and exposing you ‭for the scum weasel you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.49,0:49:33.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在一切都说得通了\N{\rEng}It all makes sense now.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.06,0:49:37.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你告诉了瑞克该何时进攻\N{\rEng}You told Rick when to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.08,0:49:40.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么占领哨站\N{\rEng}How to get to the outposts...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.99,0:49:44.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你把我们困在了这里\N{\rEng}You keep us locked in here,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.61,0:49:46.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,偷偷给他们工人的枪\N{\rEng}slipping them workers guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.72,0:49:51.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许你说杀了雪莉也是骗我的\N{\rEng}Maybe you even lied to me about killing Sherry.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.37,0:49:54.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\rEng}Oh, hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.49,0:49:57.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那件事你肯定是骗我了\N{\rEng}You, for sure, lied to me about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.26,0:50:00.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以呢\N{\rEng}So, what? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.86,0:50:04.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为你是英雄吗\N{\rEng}You think you're some sort of a hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.24,0:50:08.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  你什么都不是\N{\rEng}No. You are nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.51,0:50:11.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个糊涂的无名小卒\N{\rEng}A nobody in way over your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.64,0:50:13.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但当我说\N{\rEng}But when I said
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.66,0:50:16.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每当我有需要  你从不令我失望时\N{\rEng}that you would come through for me when I needed it,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.34,0:50:19.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是110%认真的\N{\rEng}oh, I meant that 110%.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.96,0:50:23.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道我能指望你把我的计划告诉瑞克\N{\rEng}See, I knew ‭that I could count on you to deliver my plan to Rick,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.63,0:50:28.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我那聪明绝顶的假计划  要我说的话\N{\rEng}my brilliant, if I do say so myself, fake-ass plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.59,0:50:35.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你让格雷戈里传话去了  对吧\N{\rEng}You used Gregory for that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.66,0:50:36.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还以为\N{\rEng}I mean, I was thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.41,0:50:39.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会找借口外出什么的  但是\N{\rEng}maybe you'd take some kind of field trip or something, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.21,0:50:43.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你给自己找了个送信小哥\N{\rEng}no, you got yourself a little delivery boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.93,0:50:45.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好样的\N{\rEng}Good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.54,0:50:48.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把情报送给瑞克和小小巡逻队\N{\rEng}To deliver all that intel to Rick and the piss patrol
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.68,0:50:52.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会引他们直接走进枪林弹雨\N{\rEng}that's gonna lead them directly into the line of fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.44,0:50:55.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们根本反应不过来\N{\rEng}They are not gonna know what hit 'em,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.14,0:51:00.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这都要感谢我的新得力手下\N{\rEng}all thanks to my new right-hand man.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.99,0:51:08.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  我想过杀了你  但是\N{\rEng}Now, see, I -- I thought about killing you, and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.60,0:51:12.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想着这种死法对一个像你这样的\N{\rEng}I thought maybe that'd be too dignified for a...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.46,0:51:18.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,背后捅刀的两面派人渣来说太有尊严了\N{\rEng}backstabbing, double-crossing dirtbag such as yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.07,0:51:23.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  小德\N{\rEng}No, Dwighty boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.66,0:51:26.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给你准备了计划\N{\rEng}I got plans for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.56,0:51:44.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生了什么\N{\rEng}What the hell happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.87,0:51:47.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备好守卫这里\N{\rEng}We need preparations to defend this place
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.79,0:51:49.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以防被再次入侵\N{\rEng}in case of another incursion.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.41,0:51:51.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已经设好了警戒线\N{\rEng}We've established a perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.37,0:51:53.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们刚收到了救世堂的信息\N{\rEng}We just got a message from the Sanctuary.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.20,0:51:54.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼根回来了\N{\rEng}Negan's back,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.49,0:51:56.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他计划灭掉山顶寨\N{\rEng}and he has plans to finish the Hilltop.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.71,0:51:58.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞克会步入陷阱\N{\rEng}Rick's walking into a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.28,0:52:00.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们明早需要完成子弹订单\N{\rEng}We'll need that bullet order filled by tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.25,0:52:12.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请转达尼根\N{\rEng}Kindly convey to Negan
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.72,0:52:15.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我个人对他回归的祝贺\N{\rEng}my personal congratulations on the occasion of his return,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.19,0:52:17.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并向他保证他的要求\N{\rEng}and assure him that his request
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.88,0:52:21.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在数量和时间上都将得到满足  \N{\rEng}will be fulfilled ‭in its entirety and on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.52,0:52:27.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错\N{\rEng}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.69,0:52:30.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果尼根需要子弹来结束这场战争\N{\rEng}If Negan needs bullets to end this war,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.66,0:52:32.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么毫无疑问  他会得到的\N{\rEng}then, by ginger, he's gonna get 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.82,0:52:33.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全都会得到\N{\rEng}All of 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.34,0:52:36.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,忘记我所说的最低数量\N{\rEng}Scotch my talk of a bare minimum.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.60,0:52:37.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  女士们先生们\N{\rEng}No, sirs and madams,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.78,0:52:40.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要在苦境中迎难而上\N{\rEng}we shall rise to the occasion with the ammunition.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.96,0:52:43.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要用每发子弹震撼他们\N{\rEng}We will blow them away with every trigger pull they require.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.13,0:52:47.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们该这样  我们会这样\N{\rEng}We shall, we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.08,0:52:51.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别搞错了  同事们\N{\rEng}Oh, trip not, colleagues.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.64,0:52:56.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会永远改变救世军的历史\N{\rEng}We will change Savior history evermore.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.81,0:53:01.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加百利\N{\rEng}Gabriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.71,0:53:06.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有人都得上\N{\rEng}It's all hands on deck,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.01,0:53:08.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你来分拣弹壳\N{\rEng}and yours are sorting shells.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.72,0:53:13.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  严格遵守我的命令\N{\rEng}Listen, you follow my lead to the letter on the lead,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.23,0:53:15.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然你就哭着去死吧\N{\rEng}or you can cry and die.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.30,0:53:34.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始\N{\rEng}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.31,0:53:37.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们用可悲的人生做些有用的事吧\N{\rEng}Time to do something useful with our pathetic lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.26,0:53:55.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼根  我是米琼恩\N{\rEng}Negan, it's Michonne.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.49,0:54:05.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会等着\N{\rEng}I'll wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.85,0:54:13.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,留脏辫  拿刀那个吗\N{\rEng}The one with the dreads, the sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.42,0:54:15.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你吗\N{\rEng}Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.32,0:54:18.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞克在你身边吗\N{\rEng}Rick there with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.52,0:54:20.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,何不让他通话\N{\rEng}Why don't you put him on?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.59,0:54:24.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我打给你不是为了瑞克  而是为了卡尔\N{\rEng}This isn't about Rick. It's about Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.58,0:54:30.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他给你写了一封信\N{\rEng}He wrote you a letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.61,0:54:34.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要给你  因为这是他的心愿\N{\rEng}And I'm delivering it because that's what he wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.37,0:54:41.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不保证不杀信使\N{\rEng}Well, I can't promise not to kill the messenger.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.92,0:54:43.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴听好\N{\rEng}Just shut up and listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.21,0:54:57.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼根  我是卡尔\N{\rEng}"Negan, this is Carl."
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.38,0:55:01.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在帮助某人时\N{\rEng}"I was helping someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.49,0:55:03.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被咬了\N{\rEng}I got bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.14,0:55:07.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都不用做我们在做的事\N{\rEng}We didn't even have to be doing what we were doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.14,0:55:09.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是在帮某人\N{\rEng}I was just helping someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.43,0:55:11.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我要死了\N{\rEng}Now I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.59,0:55:13.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也许也死了\N{\rEng}You might be gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.12,0:55:18.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许我爸爸逼你的人交出了你  然后杀了你\N{\rEng}Maybe my Dad made your people give you up and he killed you,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.00,0:55:19.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我不这么觉得\N{\rEng}but I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.18,0:55:23.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得你还活着  你在想出路\N{\rEng}I think you're still around and you're working on a way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.54,0:55:25.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许你想到了\N{\rEng}Maybe you got out.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.52,0:55:28.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许你觉得我们无药可救\N{\rEng}Maybe you think we're a lost cause
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.73,0:55:30.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只想杀光我们\N{\rEng}and you just want to kill all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.62,0:55:33.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得你以为自己变成这样是被迫的\N{\rEng}I think you think you have to be who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.49,0:55:36.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只想知道这是不是你想要的\N{\rEng}I just wonder if this is what you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.33,0:55:38.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想问你\N{\rEng}I wanted to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.90,0:55:41.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望我能问你\N{\rEng}I wish I could've.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.98,0:55:44.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许你会打败我们\N{\rEng}Maybe you'll beat us.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.49,0:55:48.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你打败了  以后也会有别的敌人\N{\rEng}And if you do, there'll just be someone else to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.90,0:55:52.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出路是一起合作\N{\rEng}The way out is working together.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.81,0:55:54.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是原谅\N{\rEng}It's forgiveness."
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.37,0:55:58.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是相信没必要非得战斗\N{\rEng}"It's believing that it doesn't have to be a fight anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.81,0:56:01.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为确实没必要\N{\rEng}"Because it doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.01,0:56:07.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望我爸爸向你提出休战\N{\rEng}"I hope my dad offers you peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.77,0:56:10.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望你接受\N{\rEng}I hope you take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.48,0:56:13.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望一切都能改变\N{\rEng}I hope everything can change.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.45,0:56:15.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对我来说改变了\N{\rEng}It did for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.47,0:56:18.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你依然可以\N{\rEng}Start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.37,0:56:20.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重新开始\N{\rEng}You still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.17,0:56:24.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡尔\N{\rEng}Carl."
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.04,0:56:29.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一切\N{\rEng}All this...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.81,0:56:34.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已没有出路\N{\rEng}there is no getting out of it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.62,0:56:37.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使你们跪着来求我\N{\rEng}I wouldn't accept your surrender
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.81,0:56:40.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不会接受投降\N{\rEng}if you came to me on your knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.61,0:56:44.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胜利的关键不在于打败你们\N{\rEng}See, winning isn't about beating you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.87,0:56:49.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而在于杀光你们所有人\N{\rEng}Winning is about killing every last one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.49,0:56:53.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这才叫重新开始\N{\rEng}That is starting over.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.98,0:56:57.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从来不想这样\N{\rEng}I never wanted this.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.34,0:57:00.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是瑞克逼的\N{\rEng}Rick made this happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.08,0:57:03.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就这样转告他\N{\rEng}You tell him that.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.75,0:57:06.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对话到此为止\N{\rEng}No more talk.
